{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">全國政協前副主席、香港首任行政長官董建華本月8日因病離世，享年89歲，其喪禮本周末舉行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(16, 24, 32); font-family: Lato, Arial, sans-serif;\">董建華治喪委員會發訃告指，將於本周六下午3時至晚上10時在香港殯儀館福海堂設靈，翌日早上9時舉行公祭儀式。</span><br/></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"20260916 TUNG\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026yUOKhDyZWT1789493321.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"20260916 TUNG\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中央成立治喪委員會合共87人，主任是中共中央政治局委員、十四屆全國政協副主席、中央組織部部長石泰峰。四位副主任分別是全國政協副主席兼秘書長王東峰、港澳辦主任夏寶龍，全國政協副主席、前特首梁振英，以及現任行政長官李家超。餘下委員包括中聯辦主任周霽、兩名前特首林鄭月娥及曾蔭權，及多名政商界重量級領袖。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"TUNG 20260916\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026GCQxBo7RA51789493292.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"TUNG 20260916\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br/>而董建華家屬所發的訃聞指周日9時公祭、11時辭靈，隨即出殯。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.TUNG-0730.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026oruZJTtJxk1789517872.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.TUNG-0730.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T01:43:54.391115+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":279,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}